# Server-side secret for the contact endpoint (public/send-email.php).
#
# On Hostinger, create a file named  .env  in  public_html/  (the same folder
# send-email.php ends up in) containing your real Brevo transactional API key:
#
#   BREVO_API_KEY=xkeysib-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
#
# Notes:
#  - Do NOT commit the real key. This file is only an example.
#  - The Brevo "sender" in send-email.php (contact@pyonix.in) must be a verified
#    sender in the Brevo account tied to this key; change it there if needed.
#  - Enquiries are delivered to hemant.manglani01@gmail.com (edit in send-email.php).
BREVO_API_KEY=
